    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WAG</strong> is a frantic roguelike FPS where you face hordes of zombies in a dark forest. Survive the night, evolve with each death, and unlock new characters to challenge the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, you start from scratch and must explore the forest at night, leveling up to spend upgrade points and survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re defeated, you come back stronger: unlock WP to gain new characters, increasing your chances with every new attempt. Each character has different weapons and stats, letting you adapt your playstyle and strategy to every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals combine the charm of low poly with a dark flat aesthetic, creating a unique atmosphere of horror and action.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, fast-paced FPS combat against zombie hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-run point system to upgrade weapons and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique visual style and immersive atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the endless night?</p>",
